{"speciesId":9,"names":{"fr":"Tortank","es":"Blastoise","en":"Blastoise","ja":"カメックス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A brutal POKéMON with pressurized water jets on its shell. They are used for high speed tackles."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A brutal POKéMON with pressurized water jets on its shell. They are used for high speed tackles."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Once it takes aim at its enemy, it blasts out water with even more force than a fire hose."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It deliberately makes itself heavy so it can with­ stand the recoil of the water jets it fires."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The rocket cannons on its shell fire jets of water capable of punch­ ing holes through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It firmly plants its feet on the ground before shooting water from the jets on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BLASTOISE has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"BLASTOISE has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The waterspouts that protrude from its shell are highly accurate. Their bullets of water can precisely nail tin cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It crushes its foe under its heavy body to cause fainting. In a pinch, it will withdraw inside its shell."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The pressurized water jets on this brutal POKéMON’s shell are used for high- speed tackles."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It deliberately makes itself heavy so it can withstand the recoil of the water jets it fires."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The rocket cannons on its shell fire jets of water capable of punching holes through thick steel."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les trombes d’eau projetées par les canons de sa carapace peuvent percer le métal le plus résistant."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les trombes d’eau projetées par les canons de sa carapace peuvent percer le métal le plus résistant."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il écrase ses adversaires de tout son poids pour leur faire perdre connaissance. Il rentre dans sa carapace s’il se sent en danger."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para acabar con su enemigo, lo aplasta con el peso de su cuerpo. En momentos de apuro, se esconde en el caparazón."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It crushes its foe under its heavy body to cause fainting. In a pinch, it will withdraw inside its shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体が 重たく のしかかって 相手を 気絶させる。 ピンチのときは 殻に 隠れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon brutal est armé de canons hydrauliques. Ses puissants jets d’eau sont dévastateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es un Pokémon imponente. Tiene reactores de agua en el caparazón, que le sirven para atacar con fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The pressurized water jets on this brutal Pokémon’s shell are used for high-speed tackles."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"甲羅に 噴射口が あって ロケットのような 勢いで 突っこんでくる すごい やつだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tortank dispose de canons à eau émergeant de sa carapace. Ils sont très précis et peuvent envoyer des balles d’eau capables de faire mouche sur une cible située à plus de 50 m."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Blastoise lanza chorros de agua con gran precisión por los tubos que le salen del caparazón que tiene en la espalda. Puede disparar chorros de agua con tanta puntería que no fallaría al tirar contra una lata pequeña a 50 m."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Blastoise has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甲羅の 噴射口の ねらいは 正確。 水の 弾丸を ５０メートル 離れた 空き缶に 命中させる ことが できるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tortank dispose de canons à eau émergeant de sa carapace. Ils sont très précis et peuvent envoyer des balles d’eau capables de faire mouche sur une cible située à plus de 50 m."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Blastoise lanza chorros de agua con gran precisión por los tubos que le salen del caparazón que tiene en la espalda. Puede disparar chorros de agua con tanta puntería que no fallaría al tirar contra una lata pequeña a 50 m."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Blastoise has wat